//
// FocusRing — Slate. The outline a control shows while it has keyboard / gamepad focus: put it last
// in the control (it fills its parent, `gap` px outside it) and show it on `visualFocus`, which only
// keyboard and gamepad navigation set — a mouse user never sees it. Every theme's controls use it;
// a theme restyles it like any other control.
// Use:  FocusRing { visible: control.visualFocus }
Rectangle {
    property real gap: 4

    anchors.fill: parent
    anchors.margins: -gap
    radius: Theme.radius > 0 ? Theme.radius + gap : 0
    color: "transparent"
    border.width: Math.max(2, Theme.borderWidth)
    border.color: Theme.focus
    visible: false
}
